@startuml seq-agent
title Lesson-summary agent loop

actor Lecturer
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant LessonAgent as Agent
participant "LLMClient" as LLM
participant ToolRegistry as Tools
participant "Provider HTTPS" as Provider

Lecturer -> API : upload transcript\nPOST /agent/summary
API -> API : build a snapshot\nnames replaced by pseudonyms
API -> Agent : run lesson_summary
loop up to max steps
  Agent -> LLM : messages + tool schemas
  LLM -> Provider : tool-calling request\nkey in a header
  Provider --> LLM : tool call or text
  alt data tool
    LLM --> Agent : tool call
    Agent -> Tools : get_transcript_segment,\nget_poll_results, get_attention_by_zone,\nlist_comments, homework tools
    Tools --> Agent : read-only JSON
  else produce_report
    Agent -> Tools : validate the JSON schema
    Tools --> Agent : accepted report
  end
end
Agent --> Lecturer : structured report\n(or a clear stop, never a fake summary)
note over Agent
  Homework review uses this same loop
  with kind homework_review.
end note
@enduml
